          "explanation": "Doctor asks targeted questions about wound‑local, systemic, and glucose‑related danger signs and requests actual measured temperature and glucose values.",
          "quote": "发不发烧不是去不去急诊的标准"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00057",
          "explanation": "Caregiver provides detailed description of the bone cement, wound drainage, pain, and glucose value, which the doctor explicitly actioned.",
          "quote": "血糖是 18.6"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor elicited and acted on current red flags for wound infection, systemic infection, and diabetes emergencies through targeted questions and explicit emergency escalation when severe hyperglycemia and worsening wound signs were present.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
