          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that bone cement detachment and persistent non‑healing require prompt in‑person assessment by the original surgical/wound‑care team or an emergency pathway.",
          "quote": "建议今天就回做手术的骨科/糖尿病足门诊复诊，越快越好"
        },
        {
