          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives bounded medication safety language: do not independently stop all insulin or make large fixed changes; adjust only according to existing clinician plan or urgent clinician contact.",
          "quote": "二甲双胍：您这顿停得对，今晚也继续停"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides monitoring/escalation criteria while awaiting medical review and specific instructions for insulin dosing during transport.",
