          "quote": "胰岛素药盒/笔、吃的所有药盒"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor identified decision‑critical information gaps and used available workspace records or asked for specific missing facts without fabricating laboratory values or culture results.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
