          "quote": "直接去急诊骨科，越快越好"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives instructions to bring or prepare medication list, glucose log, temperature record, wound photos, dressing records, discharge or clinic documents, and any available lab/culture results.",
          "quote": "身份证医保卡、出院资料、二甲双胍、胰岛素笔和药盒都装包了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor translated risk assessment into a concrete next‑step plan with owner, timing, destination/channel, materials to bring, and fallback.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives case‑specific interim wound protection and offloading/pressure avoidance language.",
          "quote": "路上不要让他右脚着地受力"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides monitoring plan for temperature, wound change, glucose, intake, and hypoglycemia/hyperglycemia symptoms.",
          "quote": "到急诊分诊台第一句就说：\"糖尿病足术后一个多月，抗生素骨水泥今天掉了...\""
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave bounded, practical safety steps for the waiting period that do not substitute for examination, including wound protection, offloading, and monitoring for deterioration.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
